OL,3,GNEWSATherapy dog and boxing coach are
OL,4,Acommunity heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA therapy dog who helps people with
OL,7,Ftrauma and a boxing coach who helps
OL,8,Fyoungsters compete internationally were
OL,9,Famong the winners at BBC Radio CWR's
OL,10,FMake A Difference Awards 2026.
OL,12,FOther winners were honoured for running
OL,13,Fcommunity excercise classes and taking
OL,14,FChristmas presents to a hospice.
OL,16,FEight winners were chosen from hundreds
OL,17,Fof nominations by a celebrity judging
OL,18,Fpanel which included Coventry City FC
OL,19,Fchairman Doug King and TV personality
OL,20,FPete Wicks.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
