OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Make a Difference Awards began
OL,7,Fduring the Covid-19 pandemic and
OL,8,Fcontinue to celebrate individuals,
OL,9,Fgroups and organisations who go above
OL,10,Fand beyond to help others in their
OL,11,Fcommunities
